1
00:00:07,219 --> 00:00:08,370
Hey there.

2
00:00:08,810 --> 00:00:09,810
Well, good morning.

3
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:11,220
I hope you're doing well.

4
00:00:32,669 --> 00:00:33,669
Hey, kid.

5
00:00:34,189 --> 00:00:35,189
Don't go that way.

6
00:00:35,749 --> 00:00:38,860
If you value your life at all,
don't go any further down that road.

7
00:00:38,980 --> 00:00:39,980
Got it?

8
00:00:40,829 --> 00:00:42,740
An evil demon lives down that way.

9
00:00:43,180 --> 00:00:44,180
A demon?

10
00:00:44,380 --> 00:00:45,060
That's right.

11
00:00:45,180 --> 00:00:47,360
He's a monster who's called Bipolar Jugo.

12
00:00:48,169 --> 00:00:49,480
See that village over there?

13
00:00:50,299 --> 00:00:51,560
He did that years ago.

14
00:00:52,229 --> 00:00:54,060
People are still afraid to live there.

15
00:00:55,289 --> 00:00:58,840
No one that I've ever heard of has gotten
close to him and come back alive.

16
00:01:01,319 --> 00:01:04,200
I'm telling you for your own good,
please turn back!

17
00:01:13,470 --> 00:01:14,470
Well, well.

18
00:01:14,959 --> 00:01:16,070
You followed me home, huh?

19
00:01:16,430 --> 00:01:17,430
Sorry, little guy.

20
00:01:17,550 --> 00:01:18,550
You can't come in.

21
00:01:18,939 --> 00:01:20,310
You can never come inside here.

22
00:01:20,730 --> 00:01:21,730
Now go on.

23
00:01:21,949 --> 00:01:22,949
Get out of here.

24
00:01:23,339 --> 00:01:24,339
Come on, go back home.

25
00:01:41,999 --> 00:01:42,999
Get out of here.

26
00:01:43,789 --> 00:01:44,840
Don't come near me.

27
00:01:47,500 --> 00:01:48,260
I'll kill you!

28
00:01:48,320 --> 00:01:50,180
Anyone who comes in here, they'll go!

29
00:02:23,020 --> 00:02:24,040
Who is it?

30
00:02:24,620 --> 00:02:25,920
Don't come near me.

31
00:02:31,550 --> 00:02:33,170
Hey, get out of here.

32
00:02:33,330 --> 00:02:34,330
Go away!

33
00:02:40,370 --> 00:02:42,330
Go, or I'll kill you.

34
00:02:44,230 --> 00:02:45,390
I'll kill you!

35
00:02:45,630 --> 00:02:47,150
Is that what you want?

36
00:02:59,540 --> 00:03:00,540
I'm impressed.

37
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:01,800
You're very strong.

38
00:03:02,780 --> 00:03:04,860
I almost thought you were going to get me.

39
00:03:05,140 --> 00:03:06,520
Who are you?

40
00:03:06,620 --> 00:03:07,620
Why are you here?

41
00:03:08,260 --> 00:03:09,260
I'm Kimimaro.

42
00:03:09,620 --> 00:03:11,860
The reason I came here was to find you.

43
00:03:12,220 --> 00:03:15,720
Tell me, would you like to come join Lord
Orochimaru?

44
00:03:16,820 --> 00:03:17,820
Orochimaru?

45
00:03:18,550 --> 00:03:20,600
There are many others like you and me
there.

46
00:03:21,900 --> 00:03:25,560
Outcasts, exiles, all alone just as you
are right now.

47
00:03:26,025 --> 00:03:29,200
If you join us, you won't have to be alone
anymore.

48
00:03:29,760 --> 00:03:31,080
No, I can't.

49
00:03:31,081 --> 00:03:32,081
You don't understand.

50
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:33,420
I'm not well.

51
00:03:33,480 --> 00:03:34,600
I can't control myself.

52
00:03:35,710 --> 00:03:38,300
There's no telling when I'll try to kill
the people around me.

53
00:03:38,500 --> 00:03:39,960
No, you can't kill me.

54
00:03:40,790 --> 00:03:41,900
I'm not as weak as that.

55
00:03:43,040 --> 00:03:43,840
You're not?

56
00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:45,840
You mean you're not afraid of me?

57
00:03:46,300 --> 00:03:47,300
No, Jugo.

58
00:03:47,700 --> 00:03:48,700
Not at all.

59
00:03:51,315 --> 00:03:54,260
If you start to lose control, then I'll be
your cage.

60
00:04:06,430 --> 00:04:10,830
As long as I'm by your side, then your
soul will remain free.

61
00:04:15,730 --> 00:04:16,209
What?

62
00:04:16,410 --> 00:04:17,950
You can actually do that?

63
00:04:18,370 --> 00:04:19,370
That's right.

64
00:04:19,630 --> 00:04:23,470
I'm simply going to take the enzyme from
your body and absorb it into mine.

65
00:04:23,710 --> 00:04:27,290
And then exactly like you, I'll have the
power of the Curse Mark.

66
00:04:27,670 --> 00:04:28,590
Wait, hold on.

67
00:04:28,591 --> 00:04:31,850
The Curse Mark isn't compatible with all
who absorb it.

68
00:04:32,190 --> 00:04:35,390
If it isn't compatible
with you... I know.

69
00:04:35,910 --> 00:04:38,270
If it doesn't, then I will die.

70
00:04:38,610 --> 00:04:40,890
If you know that, then you can't do this.

71
00:04:41,150 --> 00:04:43,270
It's part of the treatment for both of us.

72
00:04:43,370 --> 00:04:46,390
The disease I carry is slowly eating away
my body.

73
00:04:46,770 --> 00:04:51,110
But if your Curse Mark works, it could
slow the disease's progress indefinitely.

74
00:04:51,970 --> 00:04:53,870
Your power could save me, Jugo.

75
00:04:55,810 --> 00:04:57,870
Please, Jugo, don't worry about me.

76
00:04:57,871 --> 00:04:59,250
I'll be just fine.

77
00:04:59,410 --> 00:05:01,190
We're best friends, after all.

78
00:05:02,580 --> 00:05:05,610
I'm absolutely sure there's no way your
power would reject me.

79
00:05:18,850 --> 00:05:22,110
Kabuto-sensei, it's as I thought,
isn't it?

80
00:05:23,570 --> 00:05:26,090
I wasn't chosen... once again.

81
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:28,560
Save your strength.

82
00:05:29,370 --> 00:05:31,790
You've served your function well,
Kimimaro.

83
00:05:33,290 --> 00:05:35,370
It's not the Sound Ninja Five anymore.

84
00:05:42,940 --> 00:05:47,301
But still, I... I
haven't... Don't worry.

85
00:05:47,395 --> 00:05:49,660
Your replacement has already been found.

86
00:05:53,300 --> 00:05:56,840
He has a mark equal in power to your Earth
Curse Mark.

87
00:05:57,400 --> 00:05:59,920
He's been given the Heaven Curse Mark.

88
00:06:00,360 --> 00:06:03,840
On top of that, he has the Kekei Genkai.

89
00:06:05,220 --> 00:06:07,041
Kekei Genkai... Kekei Genkai...

90
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:14,140
Kekei Genkai... I wonder
which one of you is stronger.

91
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:23,020
Now, now, calm down.

92
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:25,320
No sense in getting agitated.

93
00:06:38,160 --> 00:06:39,360
Kabuto-sensei...

94
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:47,580
Tell me truthfully, how much time do you
think I have left?

95
00:06:51,580 --> 00:06:52,180
Relax.

96
00:06:52,540 --> 00:06:53,820
Don't try and talk.

97
00:06:55,340 --> 00:06:56,420
I've been wondering.

98
00:06:56,880 --> 00:07:00,480
There must be a purpose for people being
born into this world.

99
00:07:02,980 --> 00:07:03,980
Why are we here?

100
00:07:04,540 --> 00:07:05,740
What does it mean?

101
00:07:06,820 --> 00:07:09,080
I've been thinking about that a lot
lately.

102
00:07:24,430 --> 00:07:29,050
I realize that finding our purpose is the
meaning.

103
00:07:30,050 --> 00:07:31,390
That's why we're here.

104
00:07:32,550 --> 00:07:34,150
And the ones who find it...

105
00:07:34,890 --> 00:07:37,130
They're the only ones who are truly free.

106
00:07:40,390 --> 00:07:42,370
Yes, I understand what you're saying.

107
00:07:43,280 --> 00:07:47,110
And meanwhile, as we speak, Lord
Orochimaru is suffering horribly.

108
00:07:47,855 --> 00:07:51,150
In fact, if something's not done soon,
it could be the end of him.

109
00:07:52,170 --> 00:07:55,950
You must ask yourself truthfully,
what should you do, Kimimaro?

110
00:07:56,700 --> 00:08:00,710
What's your purpose, now that you're no
longer of any use as a vessel?

111
00:08:02,550 --> 00:08:05,410
At this moment, a new vessel is on its
way.

112
00:08:06,210 --> 00:08:09,170
But unfortunately, it won't arrive in
time.

113
00:08:09,885 --> 00:08:10,990
It's as you say.

114
00:08:11,425 --> 00:08:16,110
My damaged body is of no use to him as a
vessel for the Transference Jutsu.

115
00:08:17,990 --> 00:08:19,050
That was my purpose.

116
00:08:19,465 --> 00:08:20,570
And it's gone.

117
00:08:21,590 --> 00:08:24,310
What is there left to give my existence
meaning?

118
00:08:25,370 --> 00:08:28,210
I see now what I must do.

119
00:08:31,110 --> 00:08:32,190
I see now what I must do.

120
00:08:32,191 --> 00:08:33,351
I was meant to be the vessel.

121
00:08:34,109 --> 00:08:35,890
I was meant to find the vessel.

122
00:08:36,839 --> 00:08:37,970
And bring it safely here.

123
00:08:38,979 --> 00:08:40,490
Even at the cost of my life.

124
00:08:41,779 --> 00:08:45,290
That is the only way I can repay Lord
Orochimaru for my failure.

125
00:08:46,319 --> 00:08:50,270
The only way to give my worthless
existence some value.

126
00:09:25,680 --> 00:09:30,140
Even so, I still want to tell you my
simple feelings.

127
00:09:32,180 --> 00:09:38,340
The wind of that day blows through me.

128
00:09:38,341 --> 00:09:41,360
I was thrown into the ruins of yesterday.

129
00:09:43,580 --> 00:09:45,340
I laugh with you.

130
00:09:45,341 --> 00:09:47,500
I live in the present.

131
00:09:49,480 --> 00:09:51,940
Even so, the sound of the bells.

132
00:09:51,941 --> 00:09:52,200
My memories.

133
00:09:52,780 --> 00:09:55,840
They must be suffering from you.

134
00:09:57,180 --> 00:10:00,360
Even so, I say goodbye.

135
00:10:01,460 --> 00:10:03,460
Without any reason.

136
00:10:04,840 --> 00:10:07,720
I just want to share it with you.

137
00:10:08,160 --> 00:10:13,320
I realize that we have forgotten that.

138
00:10:13,880 --> 00:10:16,180
Even if I sing a song with you.

139
00:10:49,660 --> 00:10:50,860
We're close.

140
00:10:51,760 --> 00:10:53,440
There's only two of them left.

141
00:10:53,760 --> 00:10:55,420
Against the three of us.

142
00:10:55,520 --> 00:10:56,860
I like those odds.

143
00:10:56,861 --> 00:10:59,098
If we play it right, the
next time we meet them,

144
00:10:59,099 --> 00:11:01,360
we'll be able to wrap
things up once and for all.

145
00:11:01,520 --> 00:11:02,120
I'll say!

146
00:11:02,340 --> 00:11:03,960
Two against three, no sweat!

147
00:11:04,420 --> 00:11:06,500
What do you mean, it's two against three?

148
00:11:08,020 --> 00:11:09,880
Oh, sorry about that, Akamaru.

149
00:11:10,080 --> 00:11:10,720
You're right.

150
00:11:10,800 --> 00:11:11,820
It's two against four.

151
00:11:11,880 --> 00:11:13,420
I like those odds even better.

152
00:11:13,960 --> 00:11:15,540
Wait till they see our new technique.

153
00:11:15,800 --> 00:11:17,760
These clowns won't know what hit them,
right, boy?

154
00:11:18,660 --> 00:11:19,760
Don't worry about a thing.

155
00:11:19,880 --> 00:11:22,102
As soon as we catch
up to them, all I gotta do

156
00:11:22,103 --> 00:11:24,500
is my shadow clone
jutsu, and the show's over!

157
00:11:25,100 --> 00:11:26,700
Well, that's comforting to know.

158
00:11:28,040 --> 00:11:31,000
All the same, we're working as a team
here, right?

159
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:32,460
Just stick to the plan.

160
00:11:33,260 --> 00:11:34,800
Oh, uh, well, sure.

161
00:11:35,360 --> 00:11:39,500
The most important thing is to at least
get them in range before the sun goes down.

162
00:11:39,700 --> 00:11:40,900
Well, what are we waiting for?

163
00:11:41,460 --> 00:11:42,460
Let's hit it!

164
00:11:54,540 --> 00:11:58,860
The sun's going down, and still no sign of
Jirobo and Kiramaru.

165
00:11:59,040 --> 00:12:01,320
Must have run into more trouble than they
expected.

166
00:12:01,800 --> 00:12:03,200
Who cares about them?

167
00:12:03,700 --> 00:12:05,540
It's Orochimaru I'm worried about.

168
00:12:08,760 --> 00:12:11,353
It's taken us most of a
whole day, and still only

169
00:12:11,354 --> 00:12:14,160
one-third of the transition
process has been completed.

170
00:12:14,420 --> 00:12:15,820
You're right, it's not good.

171
00:12:16,600 --> 00:12:18,960
At this rate, we just might be too late.

172
00:12:52,960 --> 00:12:53,960
Ah!

173
00:12:55,140 --> 00:12:56,140
Ah!

174
00:12:58,860 --> 00:12:59,860
Ah!

175
00:13:00,240 --> 00:13:00,760
Ah!

176
00:13:00,900 --> 00:13:01,200
Ah!

177
00:13:01,300 --> 00:13:01,560
Ah!

178
00:13:01,800 --> 00:13:02,320
Ah!

179
00:13:02,321 --> 00:13:02,420
Ah!

180
00:13:02,421 --> 00:13:03,421
Ah!

181
00:13:05,560 --> 00:13:07,460
I thought I saw someone..

182
00:13:08,540 --> 00:13:09,960
Oh yeah, I see now.

183
00:13:09,961 --> 00:13:11,800
They're not here yet!

184
00:13:12,880 --> 00:13:20,880
Still no sign of Sasuke!яг time's running
out he can't go on like this please my

185
00:13:20,881 --> 00:13:27,219
lord there are many other bodies ready for
you my lord they're not here yet!

186
00:13:27,220 --> 00:13:27,220
still no sign of Sasuke!

187
00:13:27,221 --> 00:13:30,101
You may even use mine, if you want You may
even use mine, if you want No!

188
00:13:30,240 --> 00:13:32,460
It must be Sasuke!

189
00:13:33,620 --> 00:13:36,240
Why do you think I've waited this long?

190
00:13:37,260 --> 00:13:38,920
But you've run out of time!

191
00:13:39,140 --> 00:13:43,940
That old man, the third Hokage,
his jutsu was stronger than we thought!

192
00:13:45,020 --> 00:13:47,000
You can't afford to wait any longer.

193
00:13:47,580 --> 00:13:51,200
If you don't take another body right now,
you'll lose everything!

194
00:13:51,420 --> 00:13:52,420
Everything!

195
00:13:56,480 --> 00:13:58,500
I've chosen several suitable vessels.

196
00:13:59,460 --> 00:14:00,620
I'll go get them ready.

197
00:14:00,621 --> 00:14:03,340
And then, I'll see to Sasuke.

198
00:14:03,580 --> 00:14:04,960
Leave everything to me.

199
00:14:11,240 --> 00:14:12,880
Curse you, old man!

200
00:14:13,980 --> 00:14:14,980
Curse you!

201
00:14:25,120 --> 00:14:26,120
Release!

202
00:14:41,440 --> 00:14:42,440
Alright!

203
00:14:42,540 --> 00:14:43,880
Listen up, all of you!

204
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:47,780
How would you like to be released from
your imprisonment?

205
00:14:47,940 --> 00:14:48,940
...

206
00:14:52,200 --> 00:14:54,340
Sadly, it's just one of you.

207
00:15:18,659 --> 00:15:19,800
What are you waiting for?

208
00:15:19,880 --> 00:15:20,600
Open this door!

209
00:15:20,900 --> 00:15:22,940
You said you would set one of us free!

210
00:15:23,250 --> 00:15:26,040
Or was that just your way of toying with
us?

211
00:15:35,629 --> 00:15:36,360
And who are you?

212
00:15:36,620 --> 00:15:38,340
I expected the other one.

213
00:15:39,289 --> 00:15:40,289
Well, however...

214
00:15:41,920 --> 00:15:42,920
...

215
00:15:43,820 --> 00:15:44,820
...

216
00:15:46,980 --> 00:15:47,980
...

217
00:16:09,230 --> 00:16:10,370
What's going on?

218
00:16:10,930 --> 00:16:12,510
I'm about to be eaten alive!

219
00:16:13,590 --> 00:16:14,590
...

220
00:16:15,850 --> 00:16:18,130
Yes, you will be set free.

221
00:16:18,410 --> 00:16:21,750
And before that, I will grant you one
wish.

222
00:16:22,390 --> 00:16:24,070
...

223
00:16:27,550 --> 00:16:30,050
You used my clan for your experiments.

224
00:16:30,870 --> 00:16:31,910
Let them go.

225
00:16:32,430 --> 00:16:33,510
That's my wish.

226
00:16:35,870 --> 00:16:37,110
Yes, of course.

227
00:16:37,370 --> 00:16:39,010
You may consider it done.

228
00:16:41,550 --> 00:16:44,759
Don't worry, your strength
of spirit was one of the main

229
00:16:44,819 --> 00:16:48,070
reasons I chose you, and I'd
be foolish to let it go to waste.

230
00:16:48,870 --> 00:16:51,810
Your residual aura will live on in me.

231
00:16:55,550 --> 00:16:56,410
Well, then.

232
00:16:56,550 --> 00:16:57,890
I thank you.

233
00:17:06,119 --> 00:17:07,329
So it's done.

234
00:17:07,869 --> 00:17:10,990
And now it will be a few years before we
can transfer again.

235
00:17:12,759 --> 00:17:14,490
But next time...

236
00:17:24,010 --> 00:17:25,410
Hold on a second.

237
00:17:27,010 --> 00:17:28,230
Are we almost there?

238
00:17:28,470 --> 00:17:29,470
No.

239
00:17:29,514 --> 00:17:30,670
We still have a ways to go.

240
00:17:30,870 --> 00:17:31,870
But take a look.

241
00:17:36,284 --> 00:17:40,250
And of course, now that we need him,
there's no sign of Jirobo or Kitomaru.

242
00:17:42,269 --> 00:17:43,430
Sorry, just us.

243
00:17:44,329 --> 00:17:45,270
Who needs those two?

244
00:17:45,310 --> 00:17:46,730
I can handle these guys myself.

245
00:17:47,210 --> 00:17:48,210
Get ready!

246
00:17:55,190 --> 00:17:56,750
This is for us!

247
00:18:01,570 --> 00:18:02,570
Charge!

248
00:18:03,190 --> 00:18:04,230
From the palm of his hand?

249
00:18:06,390 --> 00:18:08,110
Shadow clone jutsu, huh?

250
00:18:09,190 --> 00:18:10,190
RAKZENGEN!

251
00:18:11,730 --> 00:18:12,730
Caught my arm!

252
00:18:12,790 --> 00:18:17,110
Just when I... How are you supposed to
hit anyone with it if you can't throw it?

253
00:18:17,950 --> 00:18:18,950
TUNNELING BAG!

254
00:18:24,090 --> 00:18:27,170
They maneuvered SACCON right in front of
you, blocking my view.

255
00:18:27,370 --> 00:18:29,310
They were aiming for me the whole time.

256
00:18:29,450 --> 00:18:30,090
So what?

257
00:18:30,190 --> 00:18:31,770
You think that's gonna do you any good?

258
00:18:32,550 --> 00:18:33,170
So what?

259
00:18:33,170 --> 00:18:33,170
You think that's gonna do you any good?

260
00:18:33,171 --> 00:18:34,171
No!

261
00:18:34,630 --> 00:18:37,151
Uh... Uh... Uh...

262
00:18:37,569 --> 00:18:38,270
What hit me?

263
00:18:38,570 --> 00:18:41,010
It's called a shadow possession jutsu.

264
00:18:41,130 --> 00:18:42,810
He's got me pinned down!

265
00:18:44,250 --> 00:18:45,250
Meanwhile...

266
00:18:46,810 --> 00:18:47,450
TAYUYA!

267
00:18:47,550 --> 00:18:48,410
Don't just stand there!

268
00:18:48,470 --> 00:18:49,470
Get that guy!

269
00:18:49,730 --> 00:18:50,730
No!

270
00:18:52,090 --> 00:18:53,290
What are you doing?

271
00:18:53,430 --> 00:18:54,430
Get out of the way!

272
00:18:55,150 --> 00:18:56,630
Can't stop in time!

273
00:18:58,830 --> 00:18:59,830
AAAGH!

274
00:19:01,070 --> 00:19:02,070
Here, catch!

275
00:19:02,510 --> 00:19:03,150
TUNNELING BAG!

276
00:19:03,150 --> 00:19:03,150
Here, catch!

277
00:19:03,170 --> 00:19:04,610
Good work, Kiba!

278
00:19:04,970 --> 00:19:06,010
Okay, got it!

279
00:19:06,170 --> 00:19:07,410
You heard him, Shikamaru!

280
00:19:07,510 --> 00:19:08,510
Time to pull out!

281
00:19:08,670 --> 00:19:10,110
Don't worry, I'm coming!

282
00:19:14,230 --> 00:19:16,550
You think it's that easy?!

283
00:19:28,270 --> 00:19:29,270
He's fast!

284
00:19:35,970 --> 00:19:36,970
Akamaru!

285
00:19:37,310 --> 00:19:39,270
Once you set the bombs, get moving!

286
00:19:43,090 --> 00:19:44,770
Don't you mess with me!

287
00:19:46,670 --> 00:19:47,670
Akamaru, no!

288
00:19:47,950 --> 00:19:50,670
That's the last time you'll bark at me,
you mutt!

289
00:19:57,410 --> 00:19:58,410
Hang on!

290
00:20:06,450 --> 00:20:07,290
Kiba!

291
00:20:07,291 --> 00:20:08,291
Akamaru!

292
00:20:08,490 --> 00:20:09,990
I can't see them!

293
00:20:17,210 --> 00:20:18,210
Damn!

294
00:20:26,250 --> 00:20:27,910
You're mine now!

295
00:20:29,970 --> 00:20:31,490
There's no other way.

296
00:20:32,264 --> 00:20:33,664
I'll have to take care of this one.

297
00:20:34,149 --> 00:20:36,150
You take the coffin and carry on with the
mission.

298
00:20:36,790 --> 00:20:37,310
Shikamaru!

299
00:20:37,669 --> 00:20:38,669
Just get going!

300
00:20:45,710 --> 00:20:46,230
What?!

301
00:20:46,231 --> 00:20:47,970
What are you doing here?!

302
00:21:05,330 --> 00:21:06,330
Sorry, Naruto.

303
00:21:07,439 --> 00:21:09,550
It looks like I miscalculated.

304
00:21:11,970 --> 00:21:12,970
Kimimaro...

305
00:21:16,285 --> 00:21:17,920
You are taking too long.

306
00:21:19,720 --> 00:21:24,060
Let's go to the And what of our comrades?

307
00:21:24,400 --> 00:21:25,920
What happened to our other three men?

308
00:21:27,140 --> 00:21:30,100
This from the former members of the Sound
Ninja 5.

309
00:21:30,940 --> 00:21:31,940
No way.

310
00:21:32,340 --> 00:21:33,960
Now you're cheating death?

311
00:21:34,400 --> 00:21:37,040
I understand much more now.

312
00:21:37,320 --> 00:21:40,745
The strength of my
life-force has intensified

313
00:21:40,746 --> 00:21:43,921
since escaping the
prison of human flesh.

314
00:21:50,030 --> 00:21:54,070
I've had a taste of Lord Orochimaru's
magnificent dream.

315
00:21:56,070 --> 00:21:57,070
Orochimaru!

316
00:21:57,710 --> 00:22:01,550
This vessel is an important part of his
dream.

317
00:22:02,090 --> 00:22:05,230
It has the flesh that Lord Orochimaru
desires.

318
00:22:06,370 --> 00:22:09,630
But you have taken too much time
retrieving it.

319
00:22:13,990 --> 00:22:15,810
Another freak to deal with.

320
00:22:17,269 --> 00:22:19,210
He doesn't seem like an ordinary opponent.

321
00:22:21,304 --> 00:22:23,410
We need to buy time and sort out the
situation.

322
00:22:24,439 --> 00:22:26,719
It'd be dumb to confront him
without knowing... Hey, jerk!

323
00:22:26,985 --> 00:22:30,290
I've had just about enough of this
nonsense you're yakking about!

324
00:22:30,550 --> 00:22:30,830
Naruto!

325
00:22:31,330 --> 00:22:32,950
I'm taking Sasuke back now!

326
00:22:33,210 --> 00:22:34,210
Hey, wait a second!

327
00:22:42,509 --> 00:22:45,710
I could end your life right now if I wish
to.

328
00:22:46,350 --> 00:22:48,225
The reason I've
decided to spare you is

329
00:22:48,226 --> 00:22:51,411
because you have a duty
that you must complete.

330
00:22:51,990 --> 00:22:57,250
And my duty... is to deliver that coffin
to Lord Orochimaru intact.

331
00:22:57,770 --> 00:23:00,190
I thought you said it was too late for
that now.

332
00:23:01,510 --> 00:23:02,950
You weren't listening.

333
00:23:03,210 --> 00:23:07,890
I told you that's the body that Lord
Orochimaru desires more than anything else.

334
00:23:08,270 --> 00:23:09,610
It's his next vessel.

335
00:23:11,730 --> 00:23:13,210
Exactly, Tayuya.

336
00:23:13,610 --> 00:23:17,510
And delivering it to him is the only thing
that I can do to please him.

337
00:23:18,390 --> 00:23:22,410
As for those two pieces of garbage... I
leave them to you.

338
00:23:28,670 --> 00:23:30,050
He's taking Sasuke!

339
00:23:30,570 --> 00:23:31,570
Not again!

340
00:23:31,610 --> 00:23:32,630
I gotta go get him!

341
00:23:32,670 --> 00:23:33,750
Just calm down, Naruto!

342
00:23:34,130 --> 00:23:35,410
How can I calm down?!

343
00:23:35,411 --> 00:23:36,411
We're losing him!

344
00:23:36,530 --> 00:23:38,530
He's gonna take Sasuke away from us!

345
00:23:42,690 --> 00:23:43,690
Naruto's right.

346
00:23:43,850 --> 00:23:47,050
Our mission is to find Sasuke and bring
him back to the Leaf Village.

347
00:23:47,330 --> 00:23:49,930
We've got to choose the path that's best
for the mission.

348
00:23:50,130 --> 00:23:52,430
And if we don't... we'll fail.

349
00:23:55,650 --> 00:23:56,650
You rodents!

350
00:23:56,979 --> 00:23:58,350
I'm gonna end this in a flash!

351
00:23:58,844 --> 00:24:00,070
Naruto, listen to me.

352
00:24:00,960 --> 00:24:02,010
I've got a plan.

353
00:24:02,639 --> 00:24:04,039
But you've gotta follow it exactly.

354
00:24:06,130 --> 00:24:09,610
His only good move is that shadow clone
jutsu.

355
00:24:09,850 --> 00:24:12,010
Classic close-range moron.

356
00:24:12,210 --> 00:24:14,650
And that one's a mid-range combat type.

357
00:24:14,930 --> 00:24:17,130
Traps his enemies with a shadow jutsu.

358
00:24:17,490 --> 00:24:19,730
Thinks he's a pretty sharp platoon leader,
huh?

359
00:24:24,259 --> 00:24:25,259
Alright, you got it?

360
00:24:25,350 --> 00:24:26,350
Yeah!

361
00:24:27,709 --> 00:24:29,430
Well, let's get on with it, you wimps!

362
00:24:30,850 --> 00:24:31,370
Ugh!

363
00:24:31,590 --> 00:24:32,710
It's two-on-one!

364
00:24:32,750 --> 00:24:33,790
We've got the advantage!

365
00:24:33,791 --> 00:24:36,430
If we gang up on her, we've got a good
shot.

366
00:24:36,550 --> 00:24:37,550
What do you say, Naruto?

367
00:24:38,010 --> 00:24:39,010
Let's get her!

368
00:24:39,370 --> 00:24:39,590
Huh!

369
00:24:40,189 --> 00:24:44,050
It doesn't matter how many of you there are,
you're still a pair of worthless morons!

370
00:24:44,051 --> 00:24:45,110
Don't be cocky.

371
00:24:45,190 --> 00:24:46,770
We've got teamwork on our side.

372
00:24:46,910 --> 00:24:47,910
We'll show you!

373
00:24:51,890 --> 00:24:53,150
Bring it on!

374
00:24:53,990 --> 00:24:55,550
Now, Naruto!

375
00:24:56,690 --> 00:24:58,630
I'm gonna punch your life down!

376
00:25:05,870 --> 00:25:07,210
I'll see you around!

377
00:25:08,510 --> 00:25:09,250
What the?

378
00:25:09,390 --> 00:25:10,950
That whole thing was a trick!

379
00:25:11,390 --> 00:25:14,310
Teamwork, my foot, you dirty, conniving
little weasels!

380
00:25:19,810 --> 00:25:21,010
Nice try!

381
00:25:24,650 --> 00:25:28,990
You sure talk a pretty big game, but
you fell for the oldest trick in the book.

382
00:25:29,210 --> 00:25:30,210
You fool!

383
00:25:30,450 --> 00:25:31,910
You got some nerve!

384
00:25:33,030 --> 00:25:34,050
Oh well.

385
00:25:34,370 --> 00:25:37,290
At least I bought enough time for my
friend to get away.

386
00:25:37,650 --> 00:25:38,870
Hey, remember this.

387
00:25:39,310 --> 00:25:42,090
A person's jutsu isn't his only weapon.

388
00:25:46,600 --> 00:25:47,600
Shikamaru!

389
00:25:47,740 --> 00:25:49,020
I'm counting on you!

390
00:25:58,700 --> 00:26:02,860
When Tai Yuya comes back, I'll have to
kill her.

391
00:26:05,040 --> 00:26:06,760
Hold it right there!

392
00:26:08,500 --> 00:26:08,900
Hey!

393
00:26:09,500 --> 00:26:10,500
Let's see.

394
00:26:10,660 --> 00:26:12,600
How shall I destroy you?

395
00:26:19,480 --> 00:26:20,480
Interesting.

396
00:26:21,240 --> 00:26:22,540
Those eyes.

397
00:26:24,620 --> 00:26:27,800
It seems this one possesses an unusual
chakra.

398
00:26:28,740 --> 00:26:31,560
Tell me what Orochimaru is planning to do!

399
00:26:31,561 --> 00:26:34,260
And why the heck's he trying to get Sasuke
so bad?

400
00:26:39,380 --> 00:26:43,180
Lord Orochimaru has already acquired the
immortality jutsu.

401
00:26:43,540 --> 00:26:46,796
But a vast amount of
time is required to obtain

402
00:26:46,797 --> 00:26:49,780
every jutsu and everything
he wants from this world.

403
00:26:50,040 --> 00:26:50,680
So what?

404
00:26:50,900 --> 00:26:52,920
What does that have to do with Sasuke?

405
00:26:53,580 --> 00:26:58,840
Just because he is immortal doesn't mean
his body can maintain itself forever.

406
00:26:58,841 --> 00:27:02,024
So before his flesh
decays, a strong, new

407
00:27:02,025 --> 00:27:05,921
body must be made
into a vessel for his soul.

408
00:27:06,620 --> 00:27:10,800
Are you saying... that he's gonna use
Sasuke's body?

409
00:27:11,940 --> 00:27:12,940
That's right.

410
00:27:14,600 --> 00:27:15,600
Precisely.

411
00:27:15,800 --> 00:27:16,480
No!

412
00:27:16,680 --> 00:27:17,760
Not Sasuke!

413
00:27:18,320 --> 00:27:20,140
I won't let you do it!

414
00:27:21,020 --> 00:27:22,240
You idiot!

415
00:27:22,580 --> 00:27:25,520
You really think sending that little
shrimp will stop anything?

416
00:27:25,521 --> 00:27:29,980
Besides, just think about what's happened
to your team up to this point.

417
00:27:30,460 --> 00:27:33,501
You probably had to sacrifice
one member each time

418
00:27:33,502 --> 00:27:36,141
you faced an obstacle just
so you could keep moving.

419
00:27:39,300 --> 00:27:43,020
I mean, what the heck is so special about
this Sasuke guy anyway?

420
00:27:43,600 --> 00:27:48,920
How many are you gonna lose just to save
this one insignificant shinobi?

421
00:27:49,640 --> 00:27:51,340
You're pretty dumb for a leader.

422
00:27:55,590 --> 00:27:57,010
You got a point there.

423
00:27:57,011 --> 00:28:01,430
You see, this mission we're on is my first
one as platoon leader.

424
00:28:02,550 --> 00:28:06,530
And it's pretty nerve-wracking to see your
comrades whittled down like this.

425
00:28:07,470 --> 00:28:11,450
To be honest, I don't know if the
decisions I made were the right ones.

426
00:28:14,430 --> 00:28:17,910
As platoon leader, I'm responsible for the
safety of my men.

427
00:28:18,770 --> 00:28:21,672
You would think I'd value
the lives of my four teammates

428
00:28:21,673 --> 00:28:23,990
over the life of one guy
who's been taken prisoner.

429
00:28:25,330 --> 00:28:27,547
It's a dangerous mission,
and if I decided to

430
00:28:27,548 --> 00:28:29,770
scrap it, I'd have been
playing by the book.

431
00:28:30,230 --> 00:28:31,230
Of course.

432
00:28:31,330 --> 00:28:33,110
Then why didn't you scrap it?

433
00:28:33,350 --> 00:28:34,350
It's kinda funny.

434
00:28:34,510 --> 00:28:38,030
The world doesn't seem to play by the book
very often, does it?

435
00:28:41,760 --> 00:28:46,420
Besides, there isn't a single person in my
platoon who would ever stop fighting and

436
00:28:46,421 --> 00:28:48,660
abandon a friend who had been captured by
the enemy.

437
00:28:49,640 --> 00:28:52,600
Not even if it meant sacrificing all of
their lives.

438
00:28:52,601 --> 00:28:55,380
That goes for me, too.

439
00:28:59,820 --> 00:29:03,232
Frankly, I'm a lazy,
cloud-watching oaf who's not really

440
00:29:03,233 --> 00:29:06,200
cut out to be a leader or
bark out orders at anyone.

441
00:29:07,440 --> 00:29:11,140
But there is one thing I do pretty darn
well for my teammates.

442
00:29:13,140 --> 00:29:15,100
And that's believing in them.

443
00:29:16,260 --> 00:29:19,680
Listen, I don't look at what I've done as
sacrificing my men.

444
00:29:19,681 --> 00:29:22,900
In fact, I don't even believe that any of
them are dead.

445
00:29:24,800 --> 00:29:27,880
Don't insult my friends, or you'll pay.

446
00:29:30,920 --> 00:29:31,940
I gotcha!

447
00:29:40,520 --> 00:29:41,560
Dang it.

448
00:29:43,260 --> 00:29:44,560
Get ready, Akamaru.

449
00:29:46,340 --> 00:29:49,000
We'll hit him from both sides with fang
over fang.

450
00:29:53,020 --> 00:29:54,040
Let's do it!

451
00:29:57,620 --> 00:29:58,860
Let's do it!

452
00:29:58,861 --> 00:29:59,861
Fang over fang!

453
00:30:02,440 --> 00:30:03,440
Summoning jutsu!

454
00:30:13,920 --> 00:30:14,980
That's not good.

455
00:30:15,320 --> 00:30:16,320
Oh well.

456
00:30:17,040 --> 00:30:19,460
I'll play a little melody of death for
you.

457
00:30:22,380 --> 00:30:23,100
Let's do it!

458
00:30:23,101 --> 00:30:24,101
What's with this guy?

459
00:30:26,160 --> 00:30:27,160
What the...

460
00:30:29,580 --> 00:30:31,720
Why, this is perfect, Sakon.

461
00:30:31,800 --> 00:30:33,660
There's one of them for each of us.

462
00:30:41,375 --> 00:30:42,375
Oh...

463
00:30:42,819 --> 00:30:44,400
You're not taking Sasuke anywhere!

464
00:30:46,854 --> 00:30:49,820
There sure is a lot of garbage scattered
around here.

465
00:30:51,120 --> 00:30:53,780
But... trash is just trash, after all.

466
00:30:54,879 --> 00:30:56,860
It simply needs to be cleaned up.

467
00:30:57,739 --> 00:30:59,100
Shut your mouth!

468
00:31:02,380 --> 00:31:03,480
Come, then.

469
00:31:04,180 --> 00:31:06,140
I'm gonna crush you!

470
00:31:29,260 --> 00:31:30,260
Akamaru!

471
00:31:30,940 --> 00:31:33,620
Aha, so you're the real one, huh?

472
00:31:33,920 --> 00:31:35,290
Multiple fists barrage!

473
00:31:38,950 --> 00:31:40,150
Once more!

474
00:31:46,830 --> 00:31:49,730
My brother and I get along really well.

475
00:31:50,210 --> 00:31:52,950
Usually, U-Khan just sleeps inside of me.

476
00:31:53,150 --> 00:31:56,730
But when the moment calls for it,
he comes out to play.

477
00:31:57,910 --> 00:32:00,190
So this is his ability...

478
00:32:00,191 --> 00:32:04,510
He can poke his arms, legs and head out of
anywhere in my body.

479
00:32:04,511 --> 00:32:06,390
...to either attack or defend.

480
00:32:06,750 --> 00:32:07,990
Just like this.

481
00:32:10,750 --> 00:32:12,570
Multiple legs barrage!

482
00:32:17,510 --> 00:32:20,750
Nothing more painful than a three-legged
kick.

483
00:32:21,090 --> 00:32:23,230
Now try this on for some...

484
00:32:24,090 --> 00:32:25,510
Enough, Sakon.

485
00:32:25,610 --> 00:32:27,490
We don't have any time to play around.

486
00:32:32,870 --> 00:32:34,210
Let's wrap this up.

487
00:32:34,370 --> 00:32:36,190
We're going to phase two.

488
00:32:39,450 --> 00:32:40,450
Oh, alright.

489
00:32:45,910 --> 00:32:48,250
You're always so impatient, brother.

490
00:32:55,010 --> 00:32:56,290
I gotcha.

491
00:32:56,450 --> 00:32:57,470
You're thinking the same.

492
00:32:57,490 --> 00:32:59,490
And those horns aren't just for display,
aren't ya?

493
00:33:00,910 --> 00:33:01,910
You're right.

494
00:33:02,070 --> 00:33:05,710
As soon as that other guy popped out,
his chakra increased tenfold.

495
00:33:06,630 --> 00:33:10,110
Things seemed hopeless before,
but now we're really screwed.

496
00:33:16,150 --> 00:33:17,710
What are you saying?

497
00:33:17,910 --> 00:33:19,570
You're telling me you want to try that?

498
00:33:20,710 --> 00:33:22,170
We can't, Akamaru.

499
00:33:22,390 --> 00:33:24,290
There's nobody here to back us up.

500
00:33:24,291 --> 00:33:25,331
It'd be way too dangerous.

501
00:33:26,050 --> 00:33:27,550
You understand, don't you?

502
00:33:27,790 --> 00:33:31,330
If we whip out that jutsu, we'll use up
what little chakra we have left.

503
00:33:31,490 --> 00:33:33,630
And when it's over, we won't be able to
move.

504
00:33:34,730 --> 00:33:37,550
If we miss, we'll have died for nothing.

505
00:33:43,810 --> 00:33:44,810
Akamaru...

506
00:33:54,750 --> 00:33:56,750
So this is her melody of death.

507
00:33:57,850 --> 00:33:58,850
...

508
00:34:07,910 --> 00:34:09,011
...

509
00:34:16,350 --> 00:34:18,370
...So she controls
him with that flute.

510
00:34:18,750 --> 00:34:19,750
...

511
00:34:22,969 --> 00:34:24,010
He's not dead!

512
00:34:29,650 --> 00:34:30,929
Ok, you're dead!

513
00:34:30,969 --> 00:34:31,969
That's a good thing.

514
00:34:33,409 --> 00:34:33,929
OK, you're dead!

515
00:34:33,930 --> 00:34:35,290
Oh, darn it!

516
00:34:36,050 --> 00:34:37,650
She kept getting further away.

517
00:34:37,989 --> 00:34:38,929
What am I going to do?

518
00:34:38,930 --> 00:34:39,850
What do I do?

519
00:34:39,929 --> 00:34:40,929
What do I do?

520
00:34:43,130 --> 00:34:45,370
Oh man, this is not good.

521
00:34:52,910 --> 00:34:56,150
I must be a lousy master for you to bite
me like that.

522
00:34:59,190 --> 00:35:00,230
Okay, Akamaru.

523
00:35:00,980 --> 00:35:02,010
It's just like you said.

524
00:35:02,670 --> 00:35:04,030
We're all out of options.

525
00:35:05,010 --> 00:35:06,870
Wolf fang over fang it is.

526
00:35:20,570 --> 00:35:21,810
Now, Akamaru!

527
00:35:24,870 --> 00:35:26,110
Dynamic marking!

528
00:35:27,640 --> 00:35:29,450
What kind of cheap trick is that?

529
00:35:30,710 --> 00:35:32,150
Okay, we're good to go!

530
00:35:33,510 --> 00:35:34,530
Inuzuka Style!

531
