549
00:36:54,930 --> 00:36:55,930
Huh?

550
00:37:13,710 --> 00:37:14,710
Careful, kid.

551
00:37:14,770 --> 00:37:15,890
Don't get ahead of yourself.

552
00:37:16,530 --> 00:37:17,590
This is perfect.

553
00:37:17,810 --> 00:37:20,610
We were just thinking it'd be a good idea
to separate.

554
00:37:21,290 --> 00:37:22,290
What the hell?

555
00:37:22,470 --> 00:37:23,590
He's split in two!

556
