It's true.

557
00:37:26,310 --> 00:37:29,810
If we had taken the full brunt of that
attack, it would have been bad.

558
00:37:30,150 --> 00:37:32,270
But now the real battle begins.

559
00:37:34,610 --> 00:37:35,610
Damn it!

560
00:37:37,610 --> 00:37:39,510
Yeah, I know, Akamaru.

561
00:37:40,030 --> 00:37:42,970
Only one more chance for wolf fang over
fang.

562
00:37:43,130 --> 00:37:45,670
The next shot will be our last.

563
00:37:47,790 --> 00:37:49,630
This time they're going down.

564
00:37:50,210 --> 00:37:52,030
Wolf fang over fang!

565
